      "rationale": "This is the sole ledger-supported site for TRPC5. Computed sequence confirms seq[459]='Y' and seq[460]='N', exactly matching the paper's stated Y460|N461 junction. The site is extracellular (ECL3, topology 455\u2013476), \u22653 residues from both TM boundaries, and was used in a published full-length, cell-surface-displayed construct. No terminal sites are available: the N-terminus (1\u2013327) and C-terminus (625\u2013973) are both intracellular per the authoritative topology landmarks. ECL1 (338\u2013338) is a single residue and cannot accommodate an insert. ECL4 (536\u2013603) contains C553 and C558 (likely a disulfide pair) and has no ledger evidence. ECL2 (385\u2013404) has no ledger evidence. Therefore only this one site is reported. [validation: surface_and_function; position: validated; source: paper; entailment_verified: True]",
